-- check/bad: §10.3 again, and the other half of §1.2's tuple row: a tuple
-- gets the WELL-KNOWN methods by derivation (A.16) and nothing else, so
-- `p.fst 1` has nowhere to resolve. The hint is the field-call one only for
-- a record receiver, so this message carries none.
pub first : ( Int, Int ) -> Int
first p = p.fst 1
